    "previous_model_response": "Let the rectangle have width \\(w\\) and height \\(h\\), so its area is \\(wh\\).\n\n- Triangle \\(ABC\\) has base \\(BC=\\frac{w}{2}\\) and height \\(h\\), so its area is \\(\\frac{wh}{4}\\).\n- Triangle \\(CDE\\) has legs \\(CD=\\frac{w}{2}\\) and \\(DE=\\frac{h}{2}\\), so its area is \\(\\frac{wh}{8}\\).\n\nThus, the shaded area is\n\n\\[\nwh-\\frac{wh}{4}-\\frac{wh}{8}\n=wh\\left(1-\\frac18-\\frac18\\right)\n=\\frac58wh.\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the fraction shaded is\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\frac{5}{8}}\n\\]",
